{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ShiftWorth 專為時薪工作者、自由工作者、合約員工及斜槓族而設，助你快速了解每一更實際價值。只要開始工作時打卡、休息時暫停，完成後即可將工時轉化為清晰收入估算；原價 US $1.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>計算每更薪酬</h2>\n<p>ShiftWorth 支援即時打卡、休息追蹤，亦可手動輸入或編輯工時；並設有多個薪酬檔案，可設定時薪、貼士、獎金、超時規則及支薪週期。你可在每週、每月、支薪週期或自訂日期報告中查看總薪金與估計淨收入，同時瀏覽每日趨勢圖。資料只存放在裝置本機，無需帳戶、無廣告、無位置追蹤，亦可經 iOS 分享表匯出 CSV。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-619-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-620-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-621-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-622-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-623-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-624-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ShiftWorth – Hours &amp; Pay</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T19:39:24.200720+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}